  "description": "Baseball Western is a bold vintage display font inspired by the rugged spirit of the American West, classic baseball typography, old-school sports branding, and traditional western signage. Its strong slab-serif letterforms and distinctive western details make it perfect for creating eye-catching designs with a timeless, adventurous feel.\nPerfect for T-shirts, sports jerseys, logos, badges, posters, signs, packaging, labels, stickers, merchandise, baseball designs, western branding, and vintage apparel.\nFeatures:\n– Bold Western-inspired display style\n– Vintage and retro character\n– Strong, eye-catching letterforms\nGreat for sports and baseball designs\nPerfect for print and digital projects\nSuitable for personal and commercial projects\nSuggested Uses:\nBaseball Apparel • Western T-Shirts • Sports Branding • Jerseys • Logos • Badges • Posters • Signs • Labels • Stickers • Merchandise • Vintage Branding • Cowboy Designs • Rodeo Graphics • Sportswear",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Baseball Western is a bold vintage display font inspired by the rugged spirit of the American West, classic baseball typography, old-school sports branding, and traditional western signage. Its strong slab-serif letterforms and distinctive western details make it perfect for creating eye-catching designs with a timeless, adventurous feel.</p>\n<p>Perfect for T-shirts, sports jerseys, logos, badges, posters, signs, packaging, labels, stickers, merchandise, baseball designs, western branding, and vintage apparel.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<p>– Bold Western-inspired display style<br>\n– Vintage and retro character<br>\n– Strong, eye-catching letterforms<br>\nGreat for sports and baseball designs<br>\nPerfect for print and digital projects<br>\nSuitable for personal and commercial projects</p>\n<p>Suggested Uses:<br>\nBaseball Apparel • Western T-Shirts • Sports Branding • Jerseys • Logos • Badges • Posters • Signs • Labels • Stickers • Merchandise • Vintage Branding • Cowboy Designs • Rodeo Graphics • Sportswear</p>",
